[I] Shared user utilities of emacs and xemacs

[T] Since GNU emacs and xemacs install the same set of user helper
[T] utilities, this package contains the most useful ones.

[A] many - take a look at Emacs / Xemacs
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/editor

[L] Free-to-use
[V] 21.4.25

[D] b46d07911fc3d1adafc3c488d15ae51e95c0ca4e5f23119e20bc3f30 xemacs-21.4.25.tar.bz2 http://ftp.xemacs.org/pub/xemacs/stable/

